# THE SCREENSHOTS ARE OUTPUT, NOT SOURCE. Fifty-nine PNGs come to 13.5 MB,
# they are regenerated in one command, and this repository is public and
# carries the field app 280 officers install from. Info/ is ignored for the
# same reason. They stay on the machine that made them, so the galleries
# work locally straight away; a fresh clone runs:
#
#   npm i playwright --no-save
#   node build.js && node shoot.js && node gallery.js
#   node looks/build-looks.js && node looks/build-charts.js
#   node shoot.js --dir=looks --match='^(look-\d.*|charts|index)\.html$' --themes
#   node looks/gallery-looks.js
shots/
looks/shots/
